[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Wolverine also referred to as the glutton, carcajou, skunk bear, or quickhatch, is the largest land-dwelling weasel species, distant relative to [[Otter]] and [[Badger]].

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Aggressive in a certain radius to everyone, including most small animals and birds. They move noticeably faster than a badger.

