===Strategy===

Easy way is to have sword, put up around 50% Green opening and use 2x Sting. You have to kill them before they'll run (200 hp), you'll need 3rd-4th speed of horse to catch them. Having 30 AGI and 50 UA should be enough, but slightly painful.

==In-Game Example(s)==
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-dead.png|150px]] Dead {{PAGENAME}}. Can be skinned for [[Fresh {{PAGENAME}} Hide]].<br>
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-skinned.png|150px]] Skinned {{PAGENAME}}. Can be butchered for [[Intestines]], [[Entrails]], [[Scent Gland]] and [[Raw Wolverine]].<br>
[[File:{{PAGENAME}}-skeleton.png|150px]] {{PAGENAME}} Skeleton. Can be collected for [[Bone Material]].<br>

==Notes==
Wolverines can NOT destroy [[Burrow]]s. Thus, entering into a burrow will provide an easy escape. 

